### Create user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get me
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Sign out
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signout